## Task 4: Optional extension

The boxplot below compares body mass across penguin species. Hover over the plot to explore the distribution.

```{r}
mass_plot <- ggplot(
  penguins_clean,
  aes(x = species, y = body_mass, fill = species)
) +
  geom_boxplot(alpha = 0.8) +
  labs(
    title = "Penguin Body Mass by Species",
    x = "Species",
    y = "Body mass (g)"
  ) +
  theme_light() +
  theme(legend.position = "none")

ggplotly(mass_plot)
```
